      {
        "title": "gift vs present",
        "words": [
          "gift",
          "present"
        ],
        "explanation_ar": "الكلمتان بمعنى هدية. present أكثر شيوعًا في الكلام اليومي، وgift أكثر في المتاجر والكتابة.",
        "explanation_en": "Both mean something you give. \"Present\" is common in speech; \"gift\" is common in shops and writing.",
        "examples": [
          {
            "word": "gift",
            "sentence": "a gift shop"
          },
          {
            "word": "present",
            "sentence": "a birthday present"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "How much is it? vs It costs ...",
