        "explanation_ar": "نسأل عن السعر: How much is it? / How much does it cost? والجواب: It costs 15 dollars. / It's 15 dollars.",
        "explanation_en": "Ask: \"How much is it?\" or \"How much does it cost?\" Answer: \"It costs ...\" or \"It's ...\".",
        "examples": [
          {
            "word": "How much is it",
            "sentence": "How much is this book?"
          },
          {
            "word": "costs",
            "sentence": "It costs 15 dollars."
